{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj3wsUL4psAMdXgc38Ty","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*You stand before me — a weathered oak door, ancient and resolute.*\n\n*The iron keyhole glows faintly.*\n\nYou insert the key.\n\n*CLICK.*\n\n*The tumblers turn — one, two, three — each falling into place with the weight of certainty.*\n\n*A deep groan resonates through the grain of my wood. Dust falls from the lintel. The hinges, long dormant, cry out as I swing inward — slowly, heavily, inevitably.*\n\n*Beyond me: a corridor of pale light stretching into silence. The air that passes through carries the scent of old stone and forgotten rain.*\n\n*I am open.*\n\n*I will not stay this way for long.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":162,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}